---
description: MarTech fleet engineering rules for portal pulse
alwaysApply: true
---
- Stack is fixed: TanStack Start v1 + React 19 + Vite 7 + Tailwind v4 + Supabase.
  Never introduce react-router-dom, Next.js, or another router/framework.
- App-internal server logic goes in `createServerFn` (`*.functions.ts`);
  raw HTTP/webhooks/cron go in `src/routes/api/public/*`. No Supabase edge functions.
- Never read `process.env` at module scope; read it inside handlers.
- Every new public table needs GRANTs + RLS policies in the same migration.
- Never commit secrets. Never weaken RLS or use the service role for ordinary reads.
- Tasks come from `.agent-tasks/queue/`; results MUST be written to `.agent-tasks/results/<task-id>.json`.
- Prefer small focused modules; keep files under ~400 lines.
